   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="yal.00343.001_large.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <head type="main" hand="#h02" rend="underline">Written Impromptu in an album</head>
   
   <dateline> Dec 26 1883</dateline>
   <dateline>Germantown</dateline>
   <dateline><del rend="overstrike">Christmas</del> night</dateline>
   
   <p>
    In memory of these merry Christmas
    days &amp; nights&#8212;<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">T</del><add place="above" hand="#h02" seq="2">To</add></subst> <del rend="overstrike"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low">Mr</unclear></del> My dear
    friends Mr and Mrs. Williams <gap reason="illegible" extent="one word" resp="#ja"/>
    <del rend="overstrike">Che</del> Churchie, Mary, <unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low">Gurney</unclear>, and little
    <retrace hand="#h02" cause="emphasize">Aubrey</retrace>&#8212;<retrace hand="#h02" cause="emphasize">&#182;</retrace>A heavy snow storm blocking
    <del rend="overstrike">u</del> everything up <del rend="overstrike">u</del> keeping us <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low">all</unclear></add></del> in&#8212;but
    sou<retrace hand="#h02" cause="emphasize">ls</retrace>, hearts, <del rend="overstrike">brains,</del> thoughts seem to have
    been unloos'd <add place="above">and gone, and <unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low"><del rend="overstrike">fine</del>dively</unclear></add>&#8212;&amp; <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">while in a <unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low">sooth</unclear>
    we have all</del><add place="above" seq="2">&#8212;and so</add></subst> have haven't we <del rend="overstrike">all</del> had a
    good time, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><gap reason="illegible" resp="#ja" extent="three words"/></del> <add place="below" seq="2">little &amp; big, <unclear reason="illegible" resp="#ja" cert="low">love</unclear> &amp; all</add></subst>
   </p>
   
   <note type="archival" hand="#h03" place="bottom">See page 107</note>
   <note type="archival" hand="#h03" place="bottom">Nov boughs</note>
   
   
</body>
